# The Moonlit Path (windurst 9): Leepe-Hoppe in Windurst Waters. A WAR of San d'Oria (no SMN unlocked, no Trainer's
# Whistle). The guard (fame level 6: 424, then 425), the offer 842 (option 0, option 1: nothing; option 2: begun), 843
# while a whisper is missing (none; each of the six missing in turn, the other five held), 844 with all six (option 1,
# escaped: nothing; option 0: the Moon Bauble, the six whispers taken), 845 with the bauble. The Full Moon Fountain's
# 32001 finish (the battlefield win) is #battlefield, its no-win arm #battlefield_novar; here its result (the bauble
# taken, the Whisper of the Moon) is set by GM. 846 (Repeat 0; mask 192: no SMN, bit 6; no Trainer's Whistle, bit 7):
# escaped (0) and out of range (9): nothing; option 6: 15000 gil, completed (fame +60, Heir of the New Moon), the
# whisper taken, Timer 1 (expires at the next JST day), no Dark Mana Orb (not a Windurst char). Completed, Timer 1,
# Repeat 0: 847; a day on (Timer expired), Repeat 0: 848 (option 0, option 1: nothing; option 2: the quest deleted and
# begun again, the Moon Bauble, Repeat 1); accepted with the bauble: 845; the whisper (GM): 850 (Repeat 1, mask 192);
# option 1 (Fenrir's Stone): completed, Repeat 1 again; Timer 1, Repeat 1: 851; a day on, Timer 0 with Repeat 1: 848.
# Trades with no handler: Leepe while available (the guard false, then met).
# Defaults: Leepe-Hoppe 345 (DefaultActions); his script acts only for Tuning In / Out (Tuning In needs CoP 4-2 or later:
# never here), so the quest's Event lines (843, 845, 847, 851) answer on its turn and on the script's turn alike. Also
# named: Leepe-Hoppe by Food for Thought (accepted only) and Toraimarai Turmoil (accepted only); missions 1-3 and 7-2 (not
# current).
# The battlefield (MS_Entrance, 32000, Fenrir Prime, 32001) is in #battlefield (the win) and #battlefield_novar.
lists WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/842 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/844 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/846 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/848 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/850
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=11.4,-9.75,-195.97
fame Windurst 424
item BoneChip
login
trade Leepe-Hoppe BoneChip x1           # fame 424: no section, nothing (his script: no Tuning In)
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # fame 424 (level 5): not met; his default 345
finish
fame Windurst 425
trade Leepe-Hoppe BoneChip x1           # the guard met: no section-1 onTrade, nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # level 6: 842 (0, Carbuncle's Ruby)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 842 again
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 842 again
finish option=2                         # begun
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # accepted, no bauble, no whisper of the moon, no whisper: event 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfFlames
keyitem WhisperOfTremors
keyitem WhisperOfTides
keyitem WhisperOfGales
keyitem WhisperOfFrost
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Storms missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfStorms
delkeyitem WhisperOfFlames
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Flames missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfFlames
delkeyitem WhisperOfTremors
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Tremors missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfTremors
delkeyitem WhisperOfTides
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Tides missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfTides
delkeyitem WhisperOfGales
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Gales missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfGales
delkeyitem WhisperOfFrost
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Frost missing: 843
finish
keyitem WhisperOfFrost
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # all six: 844 (0, Carbuncle's Ruby, Moon Bauble)
finish option=1                         # escaped: nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 844 again
finish option=0                         # the Moon Bauble; the six whispers taken
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # the bauble: event 845 (0, Carbuncle's Ruby, Moon Bauble)
finish
delkeyitem MoonBauble                   # GM: the battlefield win's result (32001: the bauble taken,
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon                # the Whisper of the Moon)
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # the whisper of the moon, Repeat 0: 846 (0, earring, key, ruby, mask 192, stone, cape)
finish option=0                         # escaped: nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 846 again
finish option=9                         # out of range: nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 846 again
finish option=6                         # 15000 gil; completed; the whisper taken; Timer 1 (expiry: the next JST day); not Windurst: no orb
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # completed, Timer 1, Repeat 0: event 847 (0, Carbuncle's Ruby)
finish
wait jst=1                              # the Timer expired
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Timer 0: 848 (0, Carbuncle's Ruby, Moon Bauble)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 848 again
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 848 again
finish option=2                         # the quest deleted; the Moon Bauble; begun; Repeat 1
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # accepted, the bauble: 845
finish
delkeyitem MoonBauble
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Repeat 1: 850 (0, earring, key, ruby, mask 192, stone, cape)
finish option=1                         # Fenrir's Stone; completed; the whisper taken; Timer 1; Repeat 1 again
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # completed, Timer 1, Repeat 1: event 851
finish
wait jst=1
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # Timer 0, Repeat 1: 848
finish
